WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.010
One of the first lessons
that they teach you,

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:33.330
are giving you small, very simple mission

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.170
in which you pretend to be someone else.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:38.680
I was in the street and my instructor

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.489
showed me a passing taxi,

00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:43.880
told me, "See the number of the taxi?"

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.080
I said, "Yes."

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.560
Said, "Okay, taxi disappeared."

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.358
And he told me, "In two hours, you meet me

00:00:50.358 --> 00:00:53.250
at this and this corner and you bring me

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.860
the name and the address
of the taxi driver."

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.860
And of course I could
not use the internet,

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:02.460
of course no police, no official office,

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:06.590
because I was supposed
to pretend I'm a tourist.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.853
And I felt, what will I, what should I do?

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:14.400
So I started to go from one
taxi station to the other,

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:17.650
asking people if they
know this and this car

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:19.570
with this or this number.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:21.580
And because I forgot something,

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.750
it is very important that
I find this taxi driver

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.160
because I forgot something in his car.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:30.180
So they start calling
each other, finding out.

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:32.260
And then there was another helpful guy

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:34.863
who was willing to take me to the house

00:01:34.863 --> 00:01:37.990
of this taxi driver, which he did.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.450
And I fulfilled my mission.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.110
I was the only one from the people

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:42.540
who were in training with me,

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:45.273
who brought the information back.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:52.290
When you want to recruit someone
for an undercover mission,

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.210
you're looking for certain traits.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.290
First of all, is the ability to play act

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.950
and to impersonate someone else.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:00.870
If you don't have that,

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:04.980
then all the rest is
immaterial after that.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:08.030
And if you have to work
undercover in an enemy country,

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:09.630
your cover has to be perfect.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.070
When people suspect you,

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:14.540
it can become very unpleasant
and very dangerous.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.440
And you have to have an
identity of a real person,

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.400
a person that is living somewhere

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:23.210
with a real name with real history.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:26.120
And this is the life that you learn,

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.100
you pretend to be that person.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.900
And then, of course, you
add some other things

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.930
and other traits because
it has to suit you.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.980
So you go to the place where this person

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.320
is supposed to live, you learn the area,

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.153
you live there for a while.

00:02:39.153 --> 00:02:40.931
You take a room in a hotel, let's say,

00:02:40.931 --> 00:02:43.252
and everyday you walk to a different place

00:02:43.252 --> 00:02:46.590
until you feel that you
know the area very well,

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:50.560
because this person is supposed
to have been raised there.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.120
So you learn as much as possible.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:55.390
And when you don't know the
detail, you find in the area,

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:57.710
a detail that is good enough for it.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.410
For instance, you don't
know exactly the school

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.840
they went to, but there
is a school in the area.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.230
So this is the school that you mention

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.480
when you are being asked.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:11.163
You really have to believe
that you are this other person.

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:31.750
One very important thing to
act while being interrogated,

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.940
is never be aggressive,
never be conceited,

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.853
never show that you are
too sure of yourself.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:43.010
Be humble, be nice, be
friendly, be naive even,

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.510
pretend to not understand too much.

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:48.520
And act natural towards the situations

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.740
as if it was something completely natural

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.260
that everybody else is going through.

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:56.600
And if he starts to like
you because you're nice

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:59.630
and maybe if you make him
feel even sorry for you,

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.750
that you're maybe a bit
scared or frightened,

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.330
and then he's on your side.

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:06.166
He does not want to break you.

00:04:06.166 --> 00:04:09.210
You have to really, to act very carefully.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.160
So it's not to bring him to a place

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:16.077
where he wants to show you,
who is the stronger of the two.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.690
Whenever you go into a place,
into a store or something,

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.300
you are all the time
watching for escape routes,

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.440
just in case.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.400
It becomes part of your nature.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.320
Like noticing people around you,

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.890
noticing who's watching
you, who's talking to you.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:38.510
You just, you're more alert
than people usually are.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:41.850
If worst comes to worst,
you have an escape plan.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.880
Of course, you have a set of clothes

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:44.713
that are completely different,

00:04:44.713 --> 00:04:47.590
you change your appearance,
you change your papers,

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:49.960
and you take a car and
you cross the border.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.740
Or you have an aircraft
coming to rescue you,

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:57.440
or you go out to sea and
wait for it to being rescued.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.680
Or you are helped by
another agency in the area

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.510
who smuggle you out of the country.

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:06.927
There are many different ways to do that.

00:05:10.264 --> 00:05:13.900
You're always prepared
to grab your things,

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.550
the bare necessities
that you need for this

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.300
and just disappear from the area.

